{{!-- subject: Verify your email address --}}
<h1 style="margin:16px 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Confirm your email address
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Hello {{customerName}},</p>

<p style="margin:12px 0 0 0;color:#3f3f46;">
  Your Nest Electronics account is nearly ready. Confirm this address to finish setting it up and
  sign in.
</p>

{{> button url=verifyUrl label="Verify my email address"}}

<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;">
  This link expires in {{expiresIn}} and can be used once. If it has expired, request a new one from
  the sign-in page.
</p>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;">
  If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br />
  <span style="word-break:break-all;color:#3f3f46;">{{verifyUrl}}</span>
</p>

<p
  style="margin:20px 0 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #f4f4f5;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;"
>
  If you did not create this account, you can ignore this email — nothing further will happen and no
  account will be activated.
</p>
